            { text: 'Thanks. I\'ll be more careful about what do I download.', why: 'This is not a question, so don\'t use "do": "what I download".' },
            { text: 'Thanks. I\'ll be more carefully about what I download.', why: 'After "be", use an adjective: "careful", not "carefully".' }
